# The link's library inputs, in command-line order, each pinned by SHA-256: <digest> <root> <path>. Roots: vc6 is the
# pinned Visual C++ 6 toolchain, lab is the inputs folder BEA_LAB (untracked; never commit the files). The static libraries
# come first, then the import libraries in retail's import-descriptor order (KERNEL32 ... DINPUT8). tools/link.py
# refuses to link if any file differs. The resource file (retail's .rsrc rebuilt as a .res) is linked like a library.
